{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/czqc59f6jsw7rkucpvmgutnks8u18cf.mp3","text":"与其花时间在这里唠唠叨叨，还不如赶紧把手上的工作做完。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/jlgh8cndo4gxlf3j91icrgl8smgjv9u.mp3","text":"最好记住，适应不了恶劣环境的家伙，就只是单纯的累赘。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/66nzluocq3nnfrmntx8hnj3l2pzq54x.mp3","text":"工作、糊口、逃亡，不断循环，没什么大不了的，这世道，大家不都一样吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/non1sohcbobqsd1dawqhp0yohq4563y.mp3","text":"我的工作就是处理那些大人物的“麻烦事”，所以他们都叫我“清道夫”。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/212r957j09gyrk46bhgvflw1lz41p4n.mp3","text":"就像硬币有正反面一样，表面再怎么光鲜的东西，背面一定是无比肮脏的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/8xzv8a5vhqynekzidd6mfjnrvmmndbj.mp3","text":"我看起来比刚来的时候适应多了？嘁，还有这回事！我只是渐渐习惯了在地面上工作而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/nq72f5cghv4rsxbllelwzvumcnyet9d.mp3","text":"那家伙就是普罗旺斯吧......说是因为进入天灾区救人，结果被感染的倒霉家伙什么的......唔，尾巴居然变得那么大了吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/mns67lsv4mz1uwfqbrk28mhkor5ga9q.mp3","text":"知道吗，博士......我本来很讨厌所谓的合作关系，因为我觉得，我们一定不会喜欢彼此的做事方式。不过，不知道从什么时候开始，我发现，事情并非如此。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/2gz8tkz7sodcuxviph60o0sshchpapo.mp3","text":"如果她还活着的话......现在，我只能背负着她的愿望，独自活下去。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/ocvc9y94dqedn96zxdxmsm6g41ov1e9.mp3","text":"......为什么这家伙能在完全不设防的地方睡着？","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/251897cxvyux1pztbqsyadus4bh1jck.mp3","text":"我是清道夫，肮脏的工作我来做，你和那些家伙一样，只要付钱就行了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/4cpdvoonaphont8uodn40dzhuqvgk4t.mp3","text":"还没有，还不够......","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/gscs2rrc2sie6qy75t8ypa6elbfnsos.mp3","text":"还不够，我必须变得更强才行......","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/qgycquj950jklozf4i9j5u5cypcsfo6.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士。战斗的理由，我现在似乎弄清楚了一些。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/gxi4c0v9j8c1qvjmfptf3otiqeizl59.mp3","text":"入队而已，必须要说点什么吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/2lcndkbwy7lxc3fq9qqbme3wvwl650r.mp3","text":"你们，别拖我后腿。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/0pjlcnam3srhgbqr509en1ghs7swoox.mp3","text":"隐藏气息，别被敌人发现了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/5jkfqqirghg2wz1usch3i9pmb1qf3to.mp3","text":"哼，垃圾扫除的时间到了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/ij93kwy752ifuw1anurfnooo0t13b1r.mp3","text":"赶快。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/0lmjfgh6pz3pdgvxpmtd2ev4mbo4nvf.mp3","text":"要动手？","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/7r032a48ogiiulxiiieiuqs8ooj49ye.mp3","text":"嘁。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/10i24ydmu9e6jw4elntxhc42y17xtfg.mp3","text":"我会做的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/ryb89rki4urx3d28db3izym2etf2zql.mp3","text":"垃圾。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/q79miemsylwizpxsv4923kppgfcgzud.mp3","text":"在阴沟里挣扎吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/1ftjccul0q0m9t8rbeubjsintcpw617.mp3","text":"你已经没法回头了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/eyp0ptlxrmta3p6nwbwu5qtweonw2zy.mp3","text":"没人可怜你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/ef3xan4qtzmqczoyy8pxd9fkxwjgmbv.mp3","text":"真是一次意料之外的任务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/porvqfi0thcb8zle4o49qeo24qwasgn.mp3","text":"这样的结果，要怪就怪他们自己太过弱小。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/4jf8wlvsuxvtamlzzmt1abdo7xy2d6s.mp3","text":"嘁，放走了好几个人。如果你的指挥只有这种程度，算我白期待了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/72lw7xdlq6hv98n21ovzhb20cevtlzh.mp3","text":"可恶！又搞砸了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/2bii4j2tpeza7o1efg4jj1di1egf2h1.mp3","text":"给我个阴暗的角落就行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/mhrkk0690jwgm37g9owtp41pn30dbmr.mp3","text":"唔呃！放开我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/7glz76ud7hu3c0u2bb4qdd394qlzxc0.mp3","text":"你也想被“清理”一下吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/7d60wduq4than8cb9z78822z4u6m9h3.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/im1nkfcya7jjsupmi6tb9xww37iswzk.mp3","text":"新年？和平时没什么区别的一天罢了。如果需要我提醒你的话，人多的地方麻烦也多，最好别玩得太开心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/lt2e9llnwll4z4y4nkagfgnmojlea2x.mp3","text":"有任务？","alt":"voice_cn/char_149_scave/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/p9bkgwp047tmfx9bdsx9b2d9z52y4qx.mp3","text":"与其花时间在这里唠唠叨叨，还不如赶紧把手上的工作做完。","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/8i7r6x4vsjyt7y68d7f8qz45fwja2kj.mp3","text":"最好记住，适应不了恶劣环境的家伙，就只是单纯的累赘。","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/lc2vbxm7yvis3c56kkxzthkcsl2sw1u.mp3","text":"工作、糊口、逃亡，不断循环，没什么大不了的，这世道，大家不都一样吗？","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/95n3d3gara815urfn369nczzkie83zs.mp3","text":"我的工作就是处理那些大人物的“麻烦事”，所以他们都叫我“清道夫”。","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/eh3x42j5mldkbf9gejeqj2m8wn9n9jk.mp3","text":"就像硬币有正反面一样，表面再怎么光鲜的东西，背面一定是无比肮脏的。","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/hi85ufc3zp6brb8lpjt0pfxrp03c498.mp3","text":"我看起来比刚来的时候适应多了？嘁，还有这回事！我只是渐渐习惯了在地面上工作而已。","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/5xlzm81nmrwqe7jwbebhe0dm0acy2of.mp3","text":"那家伙就是普罗旺斯吧......说是因为进入天灾区救人，结果被感染的倒霉家伙什么的......唔，尾巴居然变得那么大了吗......","alt":"voice/char_149_scave/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/mchx8ahcnuzhy9y8tut8vus74gq99kb.mp3"